From ub35e99045f6c74c2 at groups.google.com  Fri Mar 31 20:45:40 2017
From: ub35e99045f6c74c2 at groups.google.com (Vince S. Buffalo)
Date: Fri, 31 Mar 2017 20:45:40 +0000
